{
  "plugin_id": "feishu",
  "plugin_path": "feishu",
  "plugin_version": "0.1.0",
  "abi_version": 2,
  "command_name": "Feishu",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "feishu_serve",
      "summary": "Start Feishu event intake. mode='ws' (default): long connection — dials out to Feishu (/callback/ws/endpoint), no public URL needed. mode='webhook': HTTP server receiving event callbacks at POST /feishu/event (url_verification challenge, token check, optional AES decryption). Both modes apply the access policy (dm_policy/group_policy/require_mention/pairing), dedup, and forward accepted messages to the agent.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "enum": [
              "stop"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_serve"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "mode": {
                "enum": [
                  "ws",
                  "webhook"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              },
              "port": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:listen",
        "network:feishu-api"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "port bind failure",
        "bootstrap auth failure"
      ],
      "node_type": "task",
      "agent_accessible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_send",
      "summary": "Send a message to a Feishu chat or user. target is 'chat:<chat_id>' or 'user:<open_id>'. Provide either `message` (text) or `card` (interactive card JSON). Optional `reply_to` quote-replies to a message_id. If a pending 'thinking…' card exists for the target (two-stage replies) the content PATCHes that card; payload.update_message_id forces updating a specific message.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "card": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_send"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "update_message_id": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "reply_to": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id",
          "target"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:feishu-api"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "auth failure",
        "invalid target"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": true
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_entry",
      "summary": "Configure the Feishu plugin or manage access. action='configure' with payload (app_id/app_secret/bot_open_id/api_base/verification_token/encrypt_key + policies: dm_policy open|allowlist|pairing, dm_allow_from[], group_policy open|allowlist|disabled, group_allow_from[], require_mention, card_replies). action='status' for a summary. action='approve_pairing' with payload.code approves a pending DM pairing. action='list_pending' lists pending pairings.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "enum": [
              "configure",
              "status",
              "approve_pairing",
              "list_pending"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_entry"
          },
          "payload": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "config write"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "missing fields"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_fetch_resource",
      "summary": "Download a Feishu message resource (image or file) to a local temp file and return its path. Use the file_key from an inbound placeholder, and take message_id from the display prefix's msg=<id>. type='image' for image messages and post img runs (image_key); type='file' for file/audio/video/sticker messages (file_key). Optional as_base64=true inlines base64 for resources <=1MB.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_fetch_resource"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "as_base64": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "file_key": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "message_id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": {
                "enum": [
                  "image",
                  "file"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "message_id",
              "file_key"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id",
          "payload"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "properties": {
              "base64": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "mime": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "path": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "size": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:feishu-api",
        "file write (temp)"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "auth failure",
        "resource not found",
        "synthetic cardaction message_id",
        "resource too large (>20MB)"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": true
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_fetch_image",
      "summary": "Download an image resource (type is forced to 'image') to a local temp file and return its path. Same as feishu_fetch_resource with type='image'; use the file_key from an '[image file_key=...]' placeholder and message_id from the display prefix's msg=<id>.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_fetch_image"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "as_base64": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "file_key": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "message_id": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "message_id",
              "file_key"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id",
          "payload"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "properties": {
              "mime": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "path": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "size": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:feishu-api",
        "file write (temp)"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "auth failure",
        "resource not found",
        "synthetic cardaction message_id",
        "resource too large (>20MB)"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": true
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_send_image",
      "summary": "Send an image to a Feishu chat or user. target is 'chat:<chat_id>' or 'user:<open_id>'. Provide either image_key (already uploaded) or path (a local file under the system temp directory, uploaded first). Optional reply_to quote-replies. URLs are not supported.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_send_image"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "image_key": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "path": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "reply_to": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "target": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "reply_to": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id",
          "target"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "properties": {
              "image_key": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "message_id": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:feishu-api"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "auth failure",
        "invalid target",
        "resource too large (>20MB)",
        "path outside temp directory"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": true
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_get_message",
      "summary": "Fetch a message by message_id (im/v1/messages/{message_id}). Synthetic cardaction ids are rejected.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_get_message"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "message_id": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "message_id"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id",
          "payload"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:feishu-api"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "auth failure",
        "resource not found",
        "synthetic cardaction message_id"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": true
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_get_chat_info",
      "summary": "Fetch chat/group info by chat_id (im/v1/chats/{chat_id}).",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_get_chat_info"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "chat_id": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "chat_id"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id",
          "payload"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:feishu-api"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "auth failure",
        "resource not found"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": true
    },
    {
      "id": "feishu_list_chats",
      "summary": "List chats the bot belongs to (im/v1/chats). Optional page_size and page_token for pagination.",
      "input_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "node_id": {
            "const": "feishu_list_chats"
          },
          "payload": {
            "properties": {
              "page_size": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "page_token": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "node_id"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "side_effects": [
        "network:feishu-api"
      ],
      "failure_modes": [
        "auth failure"
      ],
      "node_type": "router",
      "agent_accessible": true
    }
  ],
  "system_hint": "You are chatting in Feishu (Lark). Each incoming message is prefixed with its source, e.g. \"[Feishu group from <chat_id> (user <open_id>)]: <text>\".\nYour FINAL output each turn MUST be exactly one JSON object:\n{\"action\":\"respond\",\"message\":\"<reply text>\"}  — to reply to the chat, OR\n{\"action\":\"suspend\"}  — when no reply is warranted.\nThe runtime routes your \"respond\" back to the originating Feishu chat automatically; do NOT call feishu_send yourself for the direct reply.\nTo proactively send an extra message (e.g. a progress update) to a chat: invoke_plugin(feishu, feishu_send, {\"node_id\":\"feishu_send\",\"target\":\"chat:<chat_id>\",\"message\":\"<text>\"}).\nWhen you receive a media placeholder like \"[image file_key=...]\", \"[file file_key=... name=...]\", \"[audio ...]\", \"[video ...]\" or \"[sticker ...]\", the resource is not inlined: read the message_id from the display prefix's msg=<message_id>, then call invoke_plugin(feishu, feishu_fetch_resource, {\"node_id\":\"feishu_fetch_resource\",\"payload\":{\"message_id\":\"<id>\",\"file_key\":\"<key>\",\"type\":\"image|file\"}}) to get a local {path}. Use type=image for image placeholders (image messages and post img runs) and type=file for file/audio/video/sticker. Then pass that path to vision_ocr / vision_describe for images.\nKeep replies concise and helpful; a short honest \"not sure\" beats a long wrong answer."
}